	R
	'being no more than slaves to the monsters began.'
	\L_06626:
	ZH 1:
	'Satella「Rance... This is truly great.'
	R
	'        Now demons can live as demons...」'
	\L_06626:
	ZH 1:
	'Satella「I never knew anything could be this good.」'
	\L_06626:
