	'Kayblis「Yes, I will happily accept her.」'
	\L_06626:
	ZH 1:
	'Kayblis kept his head lowered as he walked away from'
	R
	'Demon Lord Rance.'
	\L_06626:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「Hmph... Humans are more fragile than I'
	R
	'      thought... Too bad, if we don’t let up a bit'
	R
	'      they’re all going to die out.」'
	\L_06626:
	ZH 1:
	'Satella「What should we do?」'
	\L_06626:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「Ah... I thought of an idea.'
	R
	'      Keep them as livestock.」'
	\L_06626:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「Cage naked men and women in one place...'
	R
	'      Then they’ll breed whether they want to or'
